// us.dol.futa_credit_reduction_2025 — the DOL Employment and Training
// Administration notice publishing the FUTA credit-reduction
// determinations for tax year 2025 (26 U.S.C. §3302(c)(2)).
//
// WHY A PACKAGE. 65 EXT rows of coverage/employment.json (§3302(c)/(d)/(f)/(g))
// read a «state → reduction %» parameter: a Secretary-of-Labor determination
// published as an annual Federal Register notice, not statute text. For tax
// year 2025 that notice is one: FR Doc. 2026-00342. The owner
// (`us.irc.employment`) needs the reduction contract «reduction(state) →
// figure» plus the waiver outcome, not the FR archive. Values enter owner
// cases through the derived table below; no percentage is written anywhere
// else in this package by hand (SFA_STOP_NUMBER).
//
// WHAT IT HOLDS (annual slice, still rule-less). `sources/2026-00342.pdf` —
// the official GPO bytes, pinned by sha256 (`sources/provenance.json`: URL,
// bytes, sha256, last-modified — no percentages). `sources.law` +
// `sources/tables/futa-credit-reduction-2025.lawtable.json` — the two
// reduction States as structure (state → Decimal share, 2 anchored rows)
// with quote-anchored fragments, plus `sources/futa-2025-base/en.txt`
// (pinned `pdftotext` extraction the fragments slice). All of it GENERATED
// by `corpus/tools/sources/sync/sync_us_dol_futa_credit_reduction.py`,
// never hand-edited. No rules: the value, its year and its reading belong
// to the owner. Same shape as `us.irs.rev_rul_afr` (phase 1).
//
// LAYOUT NOTE. `check_laws_tree` §3.5 derives `us/futa-credit-reduction-2025`
// from jurisdiction US + instrument guidance (`us.dol` is not a
// GROUP_BY_NAME_PREFIX group): the package name keeps the `dol` issuer
// segment, the path does not — same as `us/rev-rul-afr`.
//
// OUT OF SCOPE. Other tax years (sibling annual slices, same generator
// shape); the Title XII advance balances themselves (reference
// classifiers, no pins); SSA §901(d)(1) (reference classifier, no pin).

language "law.core" version "0.2";
package us.dol.futa_credit_reduction_2025 version "0.1.1";
namespace "urn:us:dol:futa_credit_reduction_2025:clir";
